cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Scripts in scripts/ are MIT-licensed; boundary data remains © Badan Informasi Geospasial (BIG) (non-commercial, attribution required). Please cite both this repository and the official BIG source dataset."
type: dataset
title: "Indonesia Administrative Boundaries (BIG June 2026)"
abstract: "Clean, reproducible GeoJSON and GeoPackage administrative boundaries of Indonesia covering 38 provinces and 514 kabupaten/kota districts across 3 topological tiers (official unsimplified 0°, high-detail 2e-05°, and simplified 0.001°), derived from Badan Informasi Geospasial (BIG) June 2026 data."
authors:
  - family-names: Ichsan
    given-names: Dimas Maulana
    website: "https://dmxsan.dev"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dmxsan/indonesia-admin-boundaries"
url: "https://dmxsan.dev/projects/indonesia-admin-boundaries"
version: "v2026.06"
date-released: 2026-11-25
license-url: "https://github.com/dmxsan/indonesia-admin-boundaries/blob/main/LICENSE"
keywords:
  - indonesia
  - administrative-boundaries
  - geojson
  - geopackage
  - 38-provinces
  - 514-districts
  - 3-topological-tiers
  - topological-coverage
  - badan-informasi-geospasial
  - big-june-2026
references:
